          "overview": "Gossip columnist Sierra Rayburn heads to her childhood hometown to uncover the identity of the mysterious J.L. Warrington. There, she reconnects with Tyler O'Malley, her childhood crush, and begins to suspect he’s the secret author. As they grow closer, Sierra uncovers Tyler’s truth: he is J.L., writing under a pseudonym to honor his late wife. Torn between her career and protecting Tyler’s secret, Sierra writes a viral article that boosts both their lives, leading to a heartfelt kiss by the lake and a shared future.",
